      "rationale": "Fixes a transaction origin privacy leak where nodes running with `-privatebroadcast` inadvertently serve locally retained dropped transactions to clearnet peers. Commit 6d5450244b notes that when the network drops a transaction, holding and serving it alone marks it as the node's own, defeating private broadcast protections."
